 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Lord, you have been our dwelling place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through all generations",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the mountains were born",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From everlasting to everlasting you are God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand years in your sight",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are like a day that has just gone by",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like grass that springs up in the morning",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By evening it withers and dries up",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teach us to number our days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we may gain a heart of wisdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teach us to number our days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we may gain a heart of wisdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy years, that is the span of our life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or eighty, if we have the strength",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They pass quickly, and we fly away",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn back, LORD, have compassion on your servants",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teach us to number our days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we may gain a heart of wisdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teach us to number our days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we may gain a heart of wisdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Satisfy us in the morning with your steadfast love",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we may sing for joy and be glad all our days",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
